.TH THUMTOO-ARCHIVE 1 "2026-09-16" "thumtoo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
thumtoo-archive \- list and extract archives via thumtoo backends
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B thumtoo-archive
.B list
\fIARCHIVE\fR
.P
.B thumtoo-archive
.B info
\fIARCHIVE\fR
.P
.B thumtoo-archive
.B cat
\fIARCHIVE\fR
\fIMEMBER\fR
.P
.B thumtoo-archive
.B extract
\fIARCHIVE\fR
[\fB\-C\fR \fIDIR\fR]
[\fIMEMBER\fR...]
.P
.B thumtoo-archive
.B extract\-all
\fIARCHIVE\fR
[\fB\-C\fR \fIDIR\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Uses the same archive stack as biltoo
.B //archive:
URIs: libunarr for .rar/.cbr when available, otherwise libarchive.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Usage or general error.
.TP
.B 2
Archive open / TOC failed.
.TP
.B 3
Extract failed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR thumtoo (7),
.BR thumtoo-prepare (1)
